  "description": "Read, write, calculate, template and render Word, Excel and PowerPoint documents (OOXML, legacy binary, RTF, ODF) in pure .NET. Not affiliated with Microsoft. Word-processing documents for OneDocument: open, edit and save DOCX, DOCM, DOTX, DOTM, Flat OPC, RTF and ODT with untouched parts kept byte-identical; read DOC and Word 2003 XML; import and export HTML and Markdown; styles, numbering, tables, sections, fields, notes, comments, revisions, content controls and mail merge.",
